[
 {
  "i": 0,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The prisoners we suspect are aiding Straw Hat Luffy are as follows..."
 },
 {
  "i": 1,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Prisoner number E 8200,"
 },
 {
  "i": 2,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "the pirate, Buggy the Clown..."
 },
 {
  "i": 3,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Prisoner number D 0464,"
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "former Baroque Works agent,"
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Galdino, alias Mr. 3."
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Prisoner number C 9915,"
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "another former agent of Baroque Works,"
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Bentham, alias Mr. 2 Bon Kurei."
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right now, Straw Hat Luffy and Mr. 2 Bon Kurei are causing an uproar in the N-sector of Level 3."
 },
 {
  "i": 10,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Blugori can't restrain them!"
 },
 {
  "i": 11,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It seems the two of them are headed for the stairs to Level 4."
 },
 {
  "i": 12,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\i1}However, we've yet to locate the pirate, Buggy the Clown and Galdino, Mr. 3.{\\i0}"
 },
 {
  "i": 13,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A riot in Level 2,"
 },
 {
  "i": 14,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "and intruders running wild throughout the prison..."
 },
 {
  "i": 15,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Things've gotten pretty interesting around here."
 },
 {
  "i": 16,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Great way to kill some time."
 },
 {
  "i": 17,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It'll all be over for'em anyway, once they get caught."
 },
 {
  "i": 18,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What happened to Saldeath?"
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Blugori couldn't stop Straw Hat Luffy and Mr. 2, so..."
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...he's gone to suppress the uproar in Level 2."
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why did nobody report the situation to me before it got this bad?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You were so focused on Hancock-dono that you ignored the reports, remember?"
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I ignored the reports, you say?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Did the guests leave, Warden?"
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, Sadi-chan."
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Salute the Jailer!"
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've finished preparing for the hunt..."
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So, what should we do?"
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Perfect timing. Is anyone on Level 3?"
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Minotaurus..."
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "went there."
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I see. But there's a way out of Level 3."
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I suppose he won't be able to pursue them."
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll leave the fracas on Level 2 to Saldeath..."
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Send all remaining Impel Down staff here to Level 4!"
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Understood, Sir!"
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If they manage to escape from the Minotaurus and fall down here..."
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll finish them off personally in Inferno Hell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They've underestimated this Great Prison, Impel Down!"
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "W-What's with this thing? It sure is fast!"
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's the Minotaurus!"
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Minotaurus?"
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A cold-blooded Demon Guard!"
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A monster that tosses people like trash!"
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's what it is!"
 },
 {
  "i": 46,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(600,0)}Jailer Beast"
 },
 {
  "i": 47,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(600,0)}Minotaurus"
 },
 {
  "i": 48,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\an8}A monster? A Devil Fruit user?"
 },
 {
  "i": 49,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Bon-chan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 50,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That hurt!"
 },
 {
  "i": 51,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That thing's fast!"
 },
 {
  "i": 52,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw-chan, watch out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 53,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Tamer's Whip!"
 },
 {
  "i": 54,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm... dying..."
 },
 {
  "i": 55,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Gear Second..."
 },
 {
  "i": 56,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Rubber..."
 },
 {
  "i": 57,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Jet..."
 },
 {
  "i": 58,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Bazooka!"
 },
 {
  "i": 59,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You alright, Bon-chan?"
 },
 {
  "i": 60,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I-I thought I was dying..."
 },
 {
  "i": 61,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I saw a field of Okama before my eyes..."
 },
 {
  "i": 62,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You really are strong..."
 },
 {
  "i": 63,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm sure that monster is still alive, but he must be hurt."
 },
 {
  "i": 64,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh? What?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 65,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm so angry!  This is just awful!"
 },
 {
  "i": 66,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My makeup is ruined!"
 },
 {
  "i": 67,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Cosmetics, cosmetics! I need cosmetics!"
 },
 {
  "i": 68,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That, and my toe-shoes, clothes, weapons, and..."
 },
 {
  "i": 69,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "booze, tears, and Okama Way!"
 },
 {
  "i": 70,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I wanna get down from here now.  I'm thirsty and hungry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 71,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no cause for concern, Straw-chan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 72,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Getting from Level 3 to\\NLevel 4 is as easy as throwing up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 73,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Seriously?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 74,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yep! Too, too easy! So easy! Way too easy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 75,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There it is, Straw-chan."
 },
 {
  "i": 76,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just climb the great, big wall over there."
 },
 {
  "i": 77,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The wall? You mean up there?"
 },
 {
  "i": 78,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's right."
 },
 {
  "i": 79,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But don't get so excited that you leap over it."
 },
 {
  "i": 80,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right!"
 },
 {
  "i": 81,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hot hot hot hot HOT!"
 },
 {
  "i": 82,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's with that wall?"
 },
 {
  "i": 83,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's as hot as a frying pan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 84,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A frying pan, huh? That's exactly right, Straw-chan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 85,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So, you alright?"
 },
 {
  "i": 86,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ready, and..."
 },
 {
  "i": 87,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hot!"
 },
 {
  "i": 88,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "See this, Straw-chan? Look down there."
 },
 {
  "i": 89,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's with this place?"
 },
 {
  "i": 90,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's so much hot air and smoke!"
 },
 {
  "i": 91,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's too hot to stand up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 92,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 93,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "However, the place below us is, indeed, where you wanted to go: Level 4, the Inferno Hell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 94,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Inferno.  That's below here?"
 },
 {
  "i": 95,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Indeed.  As you said,"
 },
 {
  "i": 96,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Level 4 is a massive frying pan."
 },
 {
  "i": 97,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A sea of boiling blood and fire wait for you down there."
 },
 {
  "i": 98,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You can try jumping down there, if you like,"
 },
 {
  "i": 99,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but if you don't take care in landing, you won't escape with just a burn."
 },
 {
  "i": 100,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Beyond this point, every move forward is risking your life."
 },
 {
  "i": 101,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Bon-chan,"
 },
 {
  "i": 102,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "you said there was someone you wanted to see, right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 103,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'd like to know who this guy is you're risking your life to see."
 },
 {
  "i": 104,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "People call him a \"Miracle Man\"."
 },
 {
  "i": 105,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Locked away for a crime he didn't commit, he is known as Iva-san!"
 },
 {
  "i": 106,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Queen of Kamabakka Queendom on Momoiro Island in the Grand Line!"
 },
 {
  "i": 107,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The great Okama Queen, admired by all Okama in the world!"
 },
 {
  "i": 108,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Okama Queen?"
 },
 {
  "i": 109,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Okama have queens? Awesome!"
 },
 {
  "i": 110,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's right!"
 },
 {
  "i": 111,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I want to meet him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 112,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And if I can, I'd like to save him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 113,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey wait!  We were in such a nice mood here, and you go and bring THAT thing back here?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 114,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I thought you were trying to escape!"
 },
 {
  "i": 115,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "STRAW HAT!"
 },
 {
  "i": 116,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So you wanna come along after all?"
 },
 {
  "i": 117,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "As if anyone'd wanna go to Hell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 118,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We were just hiding, and this thing just came flying at us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 119,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I dunno why, though..."
 },
 {
  "i": 120,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, I sent him flying at you."
 },
 {
  "i": 121,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, so it was you then?  WAIT JUST A MINUTE?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 122,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I've had enough of this..."
 },
 {
  "i": 123,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'd rather just get caught..."
 },
 {
  "i": 124,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Minotaurus, you... damn monster..."
 },
 {
  "i": 125,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My life's at stake here..."
 },
 {
  "i": 126,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I've got no choice but to reveal my trump card!"
 },
 {
  "i": 127,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, Straw Hat!"
 },
 {
  "i": 128,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You remember my super-powerful weapon,"
 },
 {
  "i": 129,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "that I used to strike fear into your heart, my Special Buggy-ball?"
 },
 {
  "i": 130,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Nah."
 },
 {
  "i": 131,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well...What? Uh..."
 },
 {
  "i": 132,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I had this really powerful cannonball called the Buggy-ball, you see..."
 },
 {
  "i": 133,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It was like, my favorite weapon and stuff..."
 },
 {
  "i": 134,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Buggy-ball..."
 },
 {
  "i": 135,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If you gave it your own name,"
 },
 {
  "i": 136,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "that must mean that you have a lot of faith in this Buggy-ball of yours, right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 137,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Exactly!"
 },
 {
  "i": 138,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And I've made a new weapon that lets me store a mini-version with the same power in my own body!"
 },
 {
  "i": 139,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The \"Muggy-Ball\"!"
 },
 {
  "i": 140,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You changed the name?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 141,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Take this!"
 },
 {
  "i": 142,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Special Muggy-Ball!"
 },
 {
  "i": 143,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Awesome!"
 },
 {
  "i": 144,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It worked!"
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, that's how it works."
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How's that? Remembered it yet, Straw Hat?"
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Crap! It's still conscious?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's do it, Straw-chan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, Three! You really can't use your Candle powers here?"
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It'll melt in just three seconds!"
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then I'll have to do it in three seconds."
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Flying, I'm flying! My flying Okama Kenpo!"
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Memoir of that Winter-Sky!"
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Here I go, Straw Hat!"
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Candle Lock!"
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right!"
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Rubber..."
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Hammer Rifle!"
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We did it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We beat a monster from hell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right! Now let's get going down to Level 4!"
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is Level 4."
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "All our forces have assembled here except Warden Magellan."
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stay away,"
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How much time is left before his execution?"
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "29 hours."
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Tomorrow at 15:00, this will all be over."
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Of course, that's assuming nothing goes wrong."
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We'll transfer Portgas D. Ace tomorrow morning."
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 172,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "As long as you are alright, I..."
 },
 {
  "i": 173,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vice-Admiral Momonga!"
 },
 {
  "i": 174,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is it?"
 },
 {
  "i": 175,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Red Hair has apparently gotten involved in a fight in the New World!"
 },
 {
  "i": 176,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Red Hair?"
 },
 {
  "i": 177,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Are you sure about that?"
 },
 {
  "i": 178,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why now?"
 },
 {
  "i": 179,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Against who?"
 },
 {
  "i": 180,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well... the Yonkou Kaidou!"
 },
 {
  "i": 181,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Kaidou?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 182,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "According to HQ, Kaidou said he was gonna take down Whitebeard, and Red Hair stopped him."
 },
 {
  "i": 183,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "However, it wasn't a very large battle..."
 },
 {
  "i": 184,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That sort of thing was bound to happen!"
 },
 {
  "i": 185,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My, how uneasy this sea has become."
 },
 {
  "i": 186,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "With all that's going on now, we can't deal with fights between the Yonkou!"
 },
 {
  "i": 187,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's possible there's no way to avoid a fight with Whitebeard."
 },
 {
  "i": 188,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No matter who wins, this battle will be engraved in history."
 },
 {
  "i": 189,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hurry, and set sail for Marineford!"
 },
 {
  "i": 190,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yes, Sir!"
 },
 {
  "i": 191,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(0,500)\\fs50\\pos(490,496.667)}Impel Down"
 },
 {
  "i": 192,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(0,500)\\fs40}Inside the well-hole tower"
 },
 {
  "i": 193,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How many times do I have to explain it, you freaking dumbass?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 194,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Can't you see that pillar of steam?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 195,
  "style": "Secondary",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Spinning, spinning, spinning-ing-ing!"
 },
 {
  "i": 196,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's the Inferno Hell down there!"
 },
 {
  "i": 197,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We're not going!"
 },
 {
  "i": 198,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Not to a place like Level 4!"
 },
 {
  "i": 199,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why?"
 },
 {
  "i": 200,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Whaddaya mean \"Why\"?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 201,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We're trying to break out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 202,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Break. Out. {I don't think I understand the reason for the tlc here. It makes sense as is.}"
 },
 {
  "i": 203,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We wanna go up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 204,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Up, fool!"
 },
 {
  "i": 205,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Man, what a huge blood booger..."
 },
 {
  "i": 206,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, you listening?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 207,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just give it up, Straw-chan."
 },
 {
  "i": 208,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We don't need those spineless wimps."
 },
 {
  "i": 209,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "WHO YOU CALLIN' A BIG-NOSED WIMP?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 210,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What the hell?! How could you possibly mistake what I said for THAT?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 211,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I've decided! I'm going 'round and 'round!"
 },
 {
  "i": 212,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This ain't no joke!"
 },
 {
  "i": 213,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, the ceiling just keeps getting higher and higher..."
 },
 {
  "i": 214,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're right..."
 },
 {
  "i": 215,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I was just wondering what kind of trick they were using to cause that cracking-sound..."
 },
 {
  "i": 216,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We're the ones falling down!"
 },
 {
  "i": 217,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Dammit! My Muggy-Ball was too powerful, and it caused the floor to crumble!"
 },
 {
  "i": 218,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No, no, it was because my kicks were too fierce!"
 },
 {
  "i": 219,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're wrong, it was because my punch was too strong!"
 },
 {
  "i": 220,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, no, no... It was because my wax-powers were{\\fscx250}-{\\r}"
 },
 {
  "i": 221,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, right, never mind."
 },
 {
  "i": 222,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It wasn't you, okay?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 223,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We're gonna fall into the fire!"
 },
 {
  "i": 224,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Help us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 225,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(700,0)\\fs50\\pos(867,701.666)}“Pool of Blood“"
 },
 {
  "i": 226,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, cut it out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 227,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We'll die!"
 },
 {
  "i": 228,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're just getting what's coming to you."
 },
 {
  "i": 229,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How many people have {\\i1}you{\\i0} killed up 'til now?"
 },
 {
  "i": 230,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do it."
 },
 {
  "i": 231,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've had plenty of time to reflect over what we did!"
 },
 {
  "i": 232,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's right! We're sorry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 233,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stop it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 234,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "IT'S HOT! IT'S SO HOT!"
 },
 {
  "i": 235,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "SAVE US!"
 },
 {
  "i": 236,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Carry the logs over there!"
 },
 {
  "i": 237,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No slacking off!"
 },
 {
  "i": 238,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So hot... It feels like my organs are boiling!"
 },
 {
  "i": 239,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This floor is more painful than dying!"
 },
 {
  "i": 240,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I've had enough!"
 },
 {
  "i": 241,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Make way! Move it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 242,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A prisoner is trying to escape!"
 },
 {
  "i": 243,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey, move it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 244,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You wanna get thrown into the sea of fire?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 245,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You scum! Prisoners aren't allowed to harm other prisoners!"
 },
 {
  "i": 246,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You wanna get executed right now?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 247,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(500,0)}Former Baroque Works\\NAssassin, Daz Bones"
 },
 {
  "i": 248,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(500,0)\\fs32\\pos(540,686.666)}Code name"
 },
 {
  "i": 249,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's going on?"
 },
 {
  "i": 250,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Magellan, Hannyabal and all the\\NDemon Guards are gathered here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 251,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's gonna happen here on this floor?"
 },
 {
  "i": 252,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Passage connecting level 3 and level 4"
 },
 {
  "i": 253,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\an8}It sure is hot down here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 254,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Get your protective clothes on!"
 },
 {
  "i": 255,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If Straw Hat Luffy and the others make it down here, it'll be through this door."
 },
 {
  "i": 256,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Still no reports?"
 },
 {
  "i": 257,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Perhaps the Minotaurus killed them?"
 },
 {
  "i": 258,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warden, what're you doing, hiding in there like that?"
 },
 {
  "i": 259,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hurry up, and come out."
 },
 {
  "i": 260,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't just open it all of a sudden!"
 },
 {
  "i": 261,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's too bright!"
 },
 {
  "i": 262,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warden, about that Warden's seat..."
 },
 {
  "i": 263,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "When I take over your job, please change it to a less confined one."
 },
 {
  "i": 264,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Silence. This is the Warden's special seat."
 },
 {
  "i": 265,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I want to remain in a closed-up area."
 },
 {
  "i": 266,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'd rather close my heart to you, too."
 },
 {
  "i": 267,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If we were gonna wait for this long, it'd have been better to just head..."
 },
 {
  "i": 268,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "straight to Level 3."
 },
 {
  "i": 269,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now, don't be so impatient, Sadi-chan."
 },
 {
  "i": 270,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's not me, I mean these kids."
 },
 {
  "i": 271,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They can't hold back their bloodthirstiness..."
 },
 {
  "i": 272,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "for very long."
 },
 {
  "i": 273,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1000,0)}Jailer Beast"
 },
 {
  "i": 274,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1000,0)}Minokoala (Feasty)"
 },
 {
  "i": 275,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1000,0)}Jailer Beast"
 },
 {
  "i": 276,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1000,0)}Minorhinoceros (Quiet)"
 },
 {
  "i": 277,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1000,0)}Jailer Beast"
 },
 {
  "i": 278,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1000,0)}Minozebra (Shy)"
 },
 {
  "i": 279,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Reporting in!"
 },
 {
  "i": 280,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It appears that Straw Hat Luffy has entered the Vent Column in Level 3,"
 },
 {
  "i": 281,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "though we haven't been able to contact the surveillance."
 },
 {
  "i": 282,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If so, then he'll save us a lot of trouble if he falls down here."
 },
 {
  "i": 283,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's the Pool of Blood beneath him."
 },
 {
  "i": 284,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Those guys all have Devil Fruit powers,"
 },
 {
  "i": 285,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "so if they fall in, they're dead."
 },
 {
  "i": 286,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warden Magellan! I have something to report!"
 },
 {
  "i": 287,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The intruder, Straw Hat Luffy, has already reached this floor!"
 },
 {
  "i": 288,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 289,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What do you mean?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 290,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Seems he fell down from the Vent Column."
 },
 {
  "i": 291,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But the Pool of Blood was right below the hole!"
 },
 {
  "i": 292,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How'd he survive?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 293,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm just guessing, but he might have been able to leap to safety from the giant rock that fell down with them."
 },
 {
  "i": 294,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They got lucky."
 },
 {
  "i": 295,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Also..."
 },
 {
  "i": 296,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?"
 },
 {
  "i": 297,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warden, you stink!"
 },
 {
  "i": 298,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, I messed up."
 },
 {
  "i": 299,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I mean, this is such a pain!"
 },
 {
  "i": 300,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Demon Guard, the Minotaurus, seems to have been immobilized and has fallen down with them."
 },
 {
  "i": 301,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No way?! Did they defeat him?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 302,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Probably."
 },
 {
  "i": 303,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That can't be! I refuse to believe it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 304,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Calm down!"
 },
 {
  "i": 305,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If they intend to escape from Level 4,"
 },
 {
  "i": 306,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "there are only two stairs they can use without security approval."
 },
 {
  "i": 307,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We will split the forces here into three squads."
 },
 {
  "i": 308,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hannyabal, I'll leave the protection of this staircase leading to Level 3 to you."
 },
 {
  "i": 309,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Sadi-chan, you take the Demon Guards and guard the stairs leading to Level 5."
 },
 {
  "i": 310,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're kidding! I don't want to stand guard..."
 },
 {
  "i": 311,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I want to attack them!"
 },
 {
  "i": 312,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no meaning to my life if I can't attack them, Warden!"
 },
 {
  "i": 313,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If they come here, I'll just let them escape and push the blame on the Warden..."
 },
 {
  "i": 314,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You got any complaints?"
 },
 {
  "i": 315,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, please stop..."
 },
 {
  "i": 316,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "sighing!"
 },
 {
  "i": 317,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why're you breathing on me too?"
 },
 {
  "i": 318,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My instincts told me that you had evil intentions."
 },
 {
  "i": 319,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You can do whatever you want once you've captured them."
 },
 {
  "i": 320,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's great! I can't wait!"
 },
 {
  "i": 321,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "All remaining Jailers, chase after them!"
 },
 {
  "i": 322,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You have permission to kill them!"
 },
 {
  "i": 323,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yes, Sir!"
 },
 {
  "i": 324,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But please, don't kill them completely!"
 },
 {
  "i": 325,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't underestimate me,\\NStraw Hat Luffy and your gang!"
 },
 {
  "i": 326,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I won't let you have your way any longer!"
 },
 {
  "i": 327,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I will settle this here, in Inferno Hell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 328,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hot!"
 },
 {
  "i": 329,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's up with this corridor, it's flashily hot!"
 },
 {
  "i": 330,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(1000,1000)}Near the \"Pool of Blood\""
 },
 {
  "i": 331,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\an8}The air is so hot, even my lungs feel hot!"
 },
 {
  "i": 332,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\an8}Hurry up! We've gotta hurry and get out of here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 333,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\an8}Which way should we go?"
 },
 {
  "i": 334,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You guys are just helpless!"
 },
 {
  "i": 335,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If you clear your mind, the fire is just another Okama."
 },
 {
  "i": 336,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Not that I don't understand how you feel, though."
 },
 {
  "i": 337,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This floor is even hotter than the one above us."
 },
 {
  "i": 338,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It IS kinda hot..."
 },
 {
  "i": 339,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I DO kinda feel like I'm getting roasted here..."
 },
 {
  "i": 340,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "HOT!!!"
 },
 {
  "i": 341,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "YOU'RE THE ONE WHO CAN'T STAND THE HEAT!"
 },
 {
  "i": 342,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Over there! Let's go!"
 },
 {
  "i": 343,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where're you going?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 344,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "HOT!!!"
 },
 {
  "i": 345,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
